{"id":"298460dd9013dccf","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-substitution-functoriality.md","title":"重索引的规范相干同构","display":"thm-substitution-functoriality — 重索引的规范相干同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality","aliases":["16-thm-substitution-functoriality","16-substitution-functoriality"],"display":"thm-substitution-functoriality — 重索引的规范相干同构","depends_on":["[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 1.4.4 and Proposition 1.4.5, pp. 49–51 (PDF 69–71)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-substitution-functoriality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-substitution-functoriality</span><span>16-substitution-functoriality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-substitution-functoriality — 重索引的规范相干同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.4.4 and Proposition 1.4.5, pp. 49–51 (PDF 69–71)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a> 的重索引函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:J\\to K\">\\(v:J\\to K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:K\\to L\">\\(w:K\\to L\\)</span> 是基态射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_{I,X}\">\\(i_{I,X}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{u,v,Z}\">\\(c_{u,v,Z}\\)</span> 为下文通过单元素集合定义的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatIso}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_I=(i_{I,X})_{X\\in\\mathcal E_I}\">\\(i_I=(i_{I,X})_{X\\in\\mathcal E_I}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{u,v}=(c_{u,v,Z})_{Z\\in\\mathcal E_K}\">\\(c_{u,v}=(c_{u,v,Z})_{Z\\in\\mathcal E_K}\\)</span>；此处族记号以其下文定义的分量为准。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>；末式的提升选择与本页固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 相同。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{i_{I,X}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*X)\n\\mid\\kappa(\\operatorname{id}_I,X)\\circ h=\\operatorname{id}_X\\},\\\\\n\\{c_{u,v,Z}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*v^*Z,(vu)^*Z)\n\\mid\\kappa(vu,Z)\\circ h=\n\\kappa(v,Z)\\circ\\kappa(u,v^*Z)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\{i_{I,X}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*X)\n\\mid\\kappa(\\operatorname{id}_I,X)\\circ h=\\operatorname{id}_X\\},\\\\\n\\{c_{u,v,Z}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*v^*Z,(vu)^*Z)\n\\mid\\kappa(vu,Z)\\circ h=\n\\kappa(v,Z)\\circ\\kappa(u,v^*Z)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}\n(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}\n(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}\n(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}\n(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{\\operatorname{id}_I,u,Y}\\circ i_{I,u^*Y}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{u,\\operatorname{id}_J,Y}\\circ u^*(i_{J,Y})\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_L)\\\nc_{vu,w,Z}\\circ c_{u,v,w^*Z}\n=c_{u,wv,Z}\\circ u^*(c_{v,w,Z}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{\\operatorname{id}_I,u,Y}\\circ i_{I,u^*Y}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{u,\\operatorname{id}_J,Y}\\circ u^*(i_{J,Y})\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_L)\\\nc_{vu,w,Z}\\circ c_{u,v,w^*Z}\n=c_{u,wv,Z}\\circ u^*(c_{v,w,Z}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\ni_{I,X}=\\operatorname{id}_X\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u:I\\to J,v:J\\to K)\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_K)\\\nc_{u,v,Z}=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*v^*Z}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\ni_{I,X}=\\operatorname{id}_X\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall u:I\\to J,v:J\\to K)\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_K)\\\nc_{u,v,Z}=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*v^*Z}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>恒等箭头与笛卡尔箭头的复合仍笛卡尔，因此每一右侧集合恰为单元素；两个同基提升的唯一垂直比较有逆。对任意垂直箭头，将候选自然性方块后复合所选提升，两个复合都相同；笛卡尔唯一性给出自然性。</li>\n<li>两个单位等式及三重复合等式也由同一方法证明：将两边后复合最终提升，均化为同一个恒等或提升复合。分裂时定义式右侧已经由恒等比较满足，唯一性便给末行。</li>\n<li>原先仅写出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}^*\\cong\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}^*\\cong\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(vu)^*\\cong u^*v^*\">\\((vu)^*\\cong u^*v^*\\)</span> 现保留了规范方向、实际分量以及全部单位与结合相干条件；一般 cleavage 不能忽略这些数据。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §1.4, pp. 49–51（PDF 69–71），Definition 1.4.4、Proposition 1.4.5；本页补写笛卡尔唯一性的证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 为 [[16-df-substitution-functor]] 的重索引函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u:I\\to J$、$v:J\\to K$、$w:K\\to L$ 是基态射；$i_{I,X}$、$c_{u,v,Z}$ 为下文通过单元素集合定义的箭头。$\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]；末式的提升选择与本页固定的 $\\kappa$ 相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"v:J\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"w:K\\to L","display":false},{"tex":"i_{I,X}","display":false},{"tex":"c_{u,v,Z}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatIso}","display":false},{"tex":"i_I=(i_{I,X})_{X\\in\\mathcal E_I}","display":false},{"tex":"c_{u,v}=(c_{u,v,Z})_{Z\\in\\mathcal E_K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{i_{I,X}\\}&\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*X)\n\\mid\\kappa(\\operatorname{id}_I,X)\\circ h=\\operatorname{id}_X\\},\\\\\n\\{c_{u,v,Z}\\}&\\coloneqq\n\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(u^*v^*Z,(vu)^*Z)\n\\mid\\kappa(vu,Z)\\circ h=\n\\kappa(v,Z)\\circ\\kappa(u,v^*Z)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}\n(i_I:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{id}_I)^*),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_K,\\mathcal E_I}\n(c_{u,v}:u^*v^*\\Rightarrow(vu)^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{\\operatorname{id}_I,u,Y}\\circ i_{I,u^*Y}\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nc_{u,\\operatorname{id}_J,Y}\\circ u^*(i_{J,Y})\n=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*Y},\\\\\n&(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_L)\\\nc_{vu,w,Z}\\circ c_{u,v,w^*Z}\n=c_{u,wv,Z}\\circ u^*(c_{v,w,Z}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\Longrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall I)(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I)\\\ni_{I,X}=\\operatorname{id}_X\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall u:I\\to J,v:J\\to K)\n(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_K)\\\nc_{u,v,Z}=\\operatorname{id}_{u^*v^*Z}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}^*\\cong\\operatorname{Id}","display":false},{"tex":"(vu)^*\\cong u^*v^*","display":false}],"bytes":3275,"backlinks":[{"id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c_{a,b}$ 是 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的重索引相干同构。$L,R:\\mathcal E_{J'}\\to\\mathcal E_J$、$L',R':\\mathcal E_{I'}\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 为候选函子，$\\Phi,\\Phi',\\Psi,\\Psi'$ 为相应 Hom 映射族。$\\eta^\\Phi,\\epsilon^\\Phi$ 等取 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]] 的公式；含它们的 mate 仅在对应 $\\mathrm{AdjHom}$ 条件成立时定义。"},{"id":"d8e49782eb81e5ab","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$。$u^*$、$i_{I,X}$、$c_{u,v,Z}$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]、[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]。"},{"id":"289eaf1d577b4823","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution-functor]]。$c_{a,b,X}:a^*b^*X\\to(ba)^*X$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的规范相干同构。"},{"id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i_I,c_{u,v}$ 及 $\\mathrm{NatIso}$ 采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]]；该上游明确给出分量、单位律和结合相干律。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-457","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-substitution-functoriality|thm-substitution-functoriality — 重索引的规范相干同构]]"},{"id":"70003ea1df88d933","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"固定 cleavage $\\kappa$；重索引与两个规范自然同构采用 [[16-thm-substitution-functoriality]] 的分量构造及相干律。"}],"outgoing":["f12a7a1ec4908770","25140205ca0312de","eb3d8d8bfc151af6"]}